# Re-include the standalone bundle Next.js traces into .next (see docker/Dockerfile.frontend
# `prebuilt`): `**/node_modules` above matches it too, which silently shipped a server.js
# with no `next` module. Last matching pattern wins, so this negation must stay last.
!frontend/.next/standalone/node_modules
